      "name": "Project evidence row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Open project content with explicit status and definition-list case details; no elevated card shell.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-project\"><h3><a href=\"https://nomasolvidos.es\">NoMasOlvidos<svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></a></h3><p class=\"ds-status\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>In development</p><dl><div><dt>Contribution</dt><dd>Google Calendar, Outlook, and email reminders work in tests. WhatsApp Business integration is pending.</dd></div></dl></article>",
