  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Work as Evidence",
    "overview": "The portfolio presents engineering work through open editorial rows, clear type, and authentic project screenshots. Its cool neutral canvas, navy text, and restrained blue accent support a professional, readable account of contributions. This describes the implemented visual world pinned in `.impeccable/surfaces/portfolio.md`.\n\nInformation remains visible in either language and theme. Fine separators establish rhythm; measured whitespace and text hierarchy do the organizing. Light is the default, with an explicitly selected dark alternative. A short optional hero movement introduces the name without concealing content.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Self-hosted Onest throughout, with fluid headings and readable supporting text.",
